# ====================================================================
# GLOBAL SECURITY AND ENVIRONMENT BLOCKS (Applies to all sub-folders)
# ====================================================================

# 🔐 HIDE ALL ENVIRONMENT SECRET FILES (Protects your database passwords & OAuth keys)
.env
.env.local
.env.*
*.env

# 📦 BLOCK ALL HEAVY DEPENDENCIES (Keeps your GitHub repository light)
node_modules/
package-lock.json
skills-lock.json

# 🛠️ CHROME / OS / IDE CLUTTER
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.agents/
.claude/
.windsurf/

# ====================================================================
# OPTIONAL ORM BLOCKS (Read below before uncommenting)
# ====================================================================
# If you also want to hide your local SQLite test databases, uncomment this:
*.db
*.db-journal
